Arquitetura:

rust
// main.rs - Hot reloadable
fn main() {
    loop {
        // Carrega plugin dinâmico
        let lib = load_library("swarm_logic.so");

        // Executa
        lib.process_requests();

        // Watch for changes
        if file_changed("swarm_logic.rs") {
            drop(lib);  // Unload
            rebuild();  // Cargo build
            continue;   // Reload novo .so
        }
    }
}
Técnicas Usadas:

Dynamic linking (.so files)
File watchers (notify-rs)
Graceful restart (preserve state)
